<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-LEADING TIMES IN LONG BEACH INDYCAR QUALIFYING.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-LEADING TIMES IN LONG BEACH INDYCAR QUALIFYING.</headline>
<dateline>LONG BEACH, California 1997-04-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times</p>
<p>after Saturday's final qualifying for Sunday's Long Beach</p>
<p>Grand Prix CART IndyCar race:</p>
<p>1. Gil de Ferran (Brazil) Reynard-Honda, 51.293 seconds</p>
<p>2. Alessandro Zanardi (Italy) Reynard-Honda, 51.665</p>
<p>3. Maurcio Gugelmin (Brazil) Reynard Mercedes-Benz, 51.745</p>
<p>4. Scott Pruett (U.S.) Reynard Ford Cosworth, 51.795</p>
<p>5. Michael Andretti (U.S.) Swift Ford Cosworth, 51.834</p>
<p>6. Roberto Moreno (Brazil) Swift Ford Cosworth, 51.911</p>
<p>7. Bryan Herta (U.S.) Reynard Ford Cosworth, 52.016</p>
<p>8. Bobby Rahal (U.S.) Reynard Ford Cosworth, 52.020</p>
<p>9. Greg Moore (Canada) Reynard Mercedes, 52.035</p>
<p>10. Jimmy Vasser (U.S.) Reynard Honda, 52.046</p>
</text>
